KEHTI THI SAKINA ROO ROO KER KAB LOUT KE AMMU AAOUGE <br>
KYUN SOGAYE SAHIL PAR JAAKER KAB LOUT KE AMMU AAOUGE<br>
<br>
1. SAB QATL HUWE KOI NA BACHA KHAIMEIN BHI JALE ASBAAB LUTA <br>
 KARTE HAI SITAM AADA MUJHPER - KAB LOUT KE AMMU AOUGE<br>
<br>
2. IS TARHA TAMACHE HAYE LAGE RUKHSAR HUWE MERE NEELE<br>
 AUR CHEEN-E-GAYE KANO SE GOUHAR - KAB LOUT KE AMMU AOUGE<br>
<br>
3. KYA HOGAYA DEKHO HUM PE SITAM BE-PARDA HUWE HAI AHLE <br>
 HARAM CHEE-NI HAI LAA-EE-NO NE CHADAR - KAB LOUT KE AMMU AOUGE<br>
<br>
4. BAZO HAI BANDHE AUR SAR HAI KHULE DARBAAR MEIN HAKIM KE HAI KHADE <br>
 KARTE HAI TAMASHA BANIYE SHAR - KAB LOUT KE AMMU AOUGE<br>
<br>
6. KAB MUJHKO CHURAA-OGE BOLO MAR JAA-ONGI EK DIN MEIN DEKHO<br>
 IS QAIDE SITAM MEIN GHUT GHUT KAR - KAB LOUT KE AMMU AOUGE<br>
<br>
7. SAHIL TA QAYAMAT KA WOH SA'MA SAB AHLE HARAM THEY MEHWE FUGA <br>
 JAB KEHTI THI SARWAR KI DUQTAR - KAB LOUT KE AMMU AOUGE<br>
